<title>USA: Clinton seeks funding of OPIC, Ex-Im Bank, TDA.</title>
<headline>Clinton seeks funding of OPIC, Ex-Im Bank, TDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton Tuesday submitted a bill to Congress reauthorizing the Export-Import Bank and the Overseas Private Investment Corp and also requested funding for the U.S. Trade and Development Agency.</p>
<p>&quot;These three specialized agencies play important complementary roles in helping U.S. firms compete for valued export markets,&quot; Clinton said in a statement issued by the White House.</p>
</text>
